---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import NewsletterBox from '../components/NewsletterBox.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Me"
  description="This is my personal blog where I discuss everything about the cloud, especially Microsoft Azure and AI."
>
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 pt-12">
    <div class="neo-box p-6 sm:p-10">
      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center gap-8 mb-8 pb-8 border-b-2 border-[var(--border-color)]">
        <div class="relative shrink-0">
          <img
            src={SITE.authorImage}
            alt={SITE.author}
            width="180"
            height="180"
            class="size-36 sm:size-44 object-cover border-3 border-[var(--border-color)] shadow-[5px_5px_0px_var(--shadow-color)]"
          />
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="neo-pill px-3 py-0.5 text-xs bg-[var(--yellow)] text-black mb-3">
            About Me
          </span>
          <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black tracking-tight mt-2">
            Hi, I&apos;m <span class="neo-highlight"><span>{SITE.author}</span></span>
          </h1>
          <p class="mt-3 text-lg font-medium text-[var(--ink-muted)]">
            {SITE.authorSummary}
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 mt-5">
            <a
              href={SITE.portfolioUrl}
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="neo-btn px-4 py-2 bg-[var(--blue)] text-black text-sm rounded-full"
            >
              Visit Portfolio <i class="ri-external-link-line"></i>
            </a>
            <a
              href="https://www.youtube.com/@seifbassemazure/"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="neo-btn px-4 py-2 bg-[var(--pink)] text-black text-sm rounded-full"
            >
              <i class="ri-youtube-line text-base"></i> YouTube Channel
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="prose prose-base sm:prose-lg max-w-none">
        <p>
          Hi, my name is Seif Bassem, and I&apos;m a Cloud Solution Architect. I specialize in designing
          and delivering scalable cloud solutions that drive global customer success. In addition to
          cloud transformation, I help customers architect AI-driven solutions, ensuring they leverage
          the cloud effectively for innovation, scalability, security, and resiliency. My expertise
          extends beyond technical implementation as I actively lead and contribute to high-impact
          initiatives like the Cloud Adoption and Well-Architected Frameworks, Azure Landing Zones,
          Azure Arc Jumpstart, Azure Verified Modules, and FinOps toolkit. Additionally, I have
          developed and released multiple public tools/products, some of which have grown into
          full-fledged first-party products.
        </p>
        <p>
          I am also deeply involved in thought leadership, spearheading internal and external
          initiatives, publishing field content, accelerators, and articles, and sharing insights
          through webinars, community events, user groups, and large-scale conferences such as
          Microsoft Ignite.
        </p>
        <p>
          In this blog, I share articles and thoughts on different Azure solutions and services,
          interesting use cases of the cloud, AI engineering, and reviews of useful books I&apos;ve
          been reading.
        </p>
        <p>
          Check out my{' '}
          <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@seifbassemazure/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            YouTube channel
          </a>{' '}
          for Azure Tips &amp; Tricks.
        </p>
        <blockquote>
          <strong>Disclaimer:</strong> The blog posts and other publications are my own personal
          opinions and are by no means associated with my employer.
        </blockquote>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <NewsletterBox />
</BaseLayout>
